IR Sensors Board PCB (textual): ir_sensors.kicad_pcb

Board outline: 60mm x 10mm
Placement guidance:
- TSOP sensors spaced evenly across board along top edge
- Connector J1 at rear edge (to main board) with 6-pin JST SH
- Pogo pad area near center of front edge

Mechanical notes:
- Use small silkscreen indicators for left/center/right sensors
- Route sensor outputs as short traces to connector
